{"path":"about.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fbfbfb;--card:#ffffff;--muted:#6b7280;--accent:#5b6cff;--accent-2:#2aa198;--text:#111827;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.7)}
    html,body{height:100%;}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;color:var(--text);background:var(--bg);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;line-height:1.45}
    header{position:sticky;top:0;backdrop-filter:blur(6px);background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.6), rgba(255,255,255,0.4));border-bottom:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.04);z-index:60}
    .nav{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:14px}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:44px;height:44px;display:inline-grid;place-items:center;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:#fff;font-weight:700}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin:0 10px;font-size:15px}
    .cta{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:9px 14px;border-radius:9px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}

    .hero{max-width:1100px;margin:28px auto;padding:44px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(91,108,255,0.06), rgba(42,161,152,0.03));display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:28px;align-items:center}
    .hero h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:28px}
    .hero p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}
    .pattern-box{height:220px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--card);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(11,15,26,0.04);border:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.04);background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:center}

    main{max-width:1100px;margin:24px auto;padding:0 18px}
    section.card{background:var(--card);padding:22px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:18px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(11,15,26,0.03)}
    h2{margin:0 0 6px}
    .muted{color:var(--muted)}

    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:20px;align-items:start}
    .list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    .pill{display:inline-block;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(91,108,255,0.08);color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}

    .reveal-hidden{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 560ms ease, transform 560ms ease}
    .reveal-show{opacity:1;transform:none}
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
      .reveal-hidden{transition:none}
    }

    .modal-backdrop{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(2,6,23,0.5);display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:80}
    .modal{width:760px;max-width:92%;background:var(--card);border-radius:12px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 18px 40px rgba(2,6,23,0.4)}
    .modal h3{margin:0 0 6px}
    .flex{display:flex;gap:12px}
    .btn{padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.06);background:transparent}
    .primary{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border:none}

    footer{max-width:1100px;margin:34px auto;padding:20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* breathing circle */
    .breath-circle{width:120px;height:120px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(91,108,255,0.12),rgba(42,161,152,0.06));display:grid;place-items:center;margin:14px auto}
    .count{font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}

    @media (max-width:820px){.hero,.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.pattern-box{height:160px}.brand{gap:8px}.nav a{display:none}.nav .cta{padding:8px 10px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="nav">
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">TP</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px">Warm, careful clinical work for change that matters</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Primary">
        <a href="index.html">Start</a>
        <a href="about.html">About</a>
        <a href="specialties.html">Areas</a>
        <a href="approach.html">Process</a>
        <a href="fees.html">Investment</a>
        <a href="faq.html">FAQ</a>
        <a href="book.html">Schedule</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
      <div>
        <a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="hero" role="region" aria-label="About hero">
    <div>
      <h1>Licensed clinical partner for steady, private work</h1>
      <p class="muted">I offer time-limited intensives and ongoing sessions that fit around how you live. My work centers on attention to patterns, practical tools, and invitations to new choices.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:16px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center">
        <button class="btn" id="try-now">Try it now</button>
        <a class="btn" href="book.html">Request a conversation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pattern-box" aria-hidden="true">
      <div style="text-align:center;padding:18px">
        <div style="font-weight:700">Confidential clinical care</div>
        <div class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">Remote + in-person by arrangement in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <main>
    <section class="card reveal-hidden" data-reveal>
      <h2>Who I work with</h2>
      <p class="muted">People navigating change, facing repeated patterns that cause strain, or seeking a focused, private space to try a different approach. Sessions are clinical — rooted in training and reflective practice — and designed to be practical.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:12px" class="list">
        <span class="pill">Short intensives</span>
        <span class="pill">Focused therapy packages</span>
        <span class="pill">Ongoing collaboration</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card grid reveal-hidden" data-reveal>
      <div>
        <h2>My background</h2>
        <p class="muted">I bring years of clinical experience with adults and couples, training in evidence-informed approaches, and ongoing consultation. My aim is to create a private, compassionate space where we pay attention to what keeps you from the life you want.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:10px" class="small">I work within my professional scope: psychotherapy for non-crisis concerns. I do not provide emergency care. If you are in immediate danger or need urgent medical help, call your local emergency services or a crisis line immediately.</p>
      </div>
      <aside>
        <div style="background:var(--glass);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(11,15,26,0.04)">
          <div style="font-weight:700">Typical session</div>
          <div class="muted" style="margin-top:6px">50-minute sessions, online or in-person. We set goals together and review progress regularly.</div>
          <div style="margin-top:10px">
            <a class="btn" href="fees.html">See investment</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="card reveal-hidden" data-reveal>
      <h2>How I organize work</h2>
      <p class="muted">We choose from short, focused packages (intensives), an initial assessment period, or continuing sessions. Each option is tailored to clarify goals, reduce worry, and build reliable practices you can use between sessions.</p>

      <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:10px">
        <div style="flex:1;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(91,108,255,0.03),transparent);border:1px solid rgba(91,108,255,0.06)">
          <strong>Focused Intensives</strong>
          <div class="muted">Short sequence of meetings to address an immediate change or decision.</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex:1;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(11,15,26,0.04)">
          <strong>Collaborative Course</strong>
          <div class="muted">A set of sessions to practice new responses and track progress.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card reveal-hidden" data-reveal>
      <h2>Small practices that help</h2>
      <p class="muted">Between sessions I suggest micro-practices: brief breathing checks, a short reflective prompt, or a two-minute grounding ritual. These are optional and adapted to what fits into your life.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:10px">
        <div style="flex:1;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(11,15,26,0.04)">
          <strong>Breathing</strong>
          <div class="muted">Simple, paced breathing to interrupt spirals.</div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex:1;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(11,15,26,0.04)">
          <strong>Journaling</strong>
          <div class="muted">Tiny prompts to notice what shifted this week.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card reveal-hidden" data-reveal>
      <h2>Boundaries, privacy, and expectations</h2>
      <p class="muted">Confidentiality is foundational; I follow professional standards regarding records and limits to confidentiality. When safety concerns arise, I will discuss necessary steps to keep you or others safe and may need to involve appropriate services.</p>
      <p class="muted small" style="margin-top:8px">If you are in immediate danger or experiencing a crisis, call emergency services or a local crisis line. This practice is not a crisis center.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="card reveal-hidden" data-reveal>
      <h2>Ready to begin?</h2>
      <p class="muted">If this feels like the kind of support you want, you can book a short consult or request information about intensives and packages.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:10px;display:flex;gap:10px">
        <a class="primary btn" href="book.html">Request a consult</a>
        <button class="btn" id="try-now-2">Try it now</button>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
      <div class="small">&copy; <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
      <div class="small">Contact: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top:12px" class="small">The content of therapy is confidential as required by law. This site does not provide clinical emergency services. If you are in crisis, contact emergency services or a crisis hotline immediately.</div>
  </footer>

  <div class="modal-backdrop" id="modal" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modal-title">
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:6px">
        <h3 id="modal-title">Try it now — choose a short exercise</h3>
        <button class="btn" id="modal-close" aria-label="Close">✕</button>
      </div>
      <p class="muted">Pick a brief practice to try. These are simple, self-guided exercises meant to bring a little clarity or calm.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <button class="btn" data-ex="breathing">Breathing</button>
        <button class="btn" data-ex="journaling">Journaling</button>
        <button class="btn" data-ex="intention">Set an intention</button>
      </div>

      <div id="exercise-area" style="margin-top:12px"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // small helpers
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

    // Modal logic and guided exercises
    (function(){
      const modal = document.getElementById('modal');
      const btns = document.querySelectorAll('[data-ex]');
      const openers = [document.getElementById('try-now'), document.getElementById('try-now-2')];
      const close = document.getElementById('modal-close');
      const area = document.getElementById('exercise-area');
      let activeTimer = null;

      function openModal(){
        modal.style.display = 'flex';
        modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false');
        // focus first button
        setTimeout(()=>{ const b = modal.querySelector('[data-ex]'); if(b) b.focus(); },60);
        document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';
      }
      function closeModal(){
        modal.style.display = 'none';
        modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');
        area.innerHTML = '';
        document.body.style.overflow = ''; 
        if(activeTimer) { clearInterval(activeTimer); activeTimer = null; }
      }
      openers.forEach(o=>o && o.addEventListener('click',openModal));
      close.addEventListener('click',closeModal);
      modal.addEventListener('click',(e)=>{ if(e.target===modal) closeModal(); });
      document.addEventListener('keydown',(e)=>{ if(e.key==='Escape' && modal.style.display==='flex') closeModal(); });

      // exercise rendering
      function renderBreathing(){
        area.innerHTML = '';
        const wrap = document.createElement('div');
        wrap.innerHTML = '<div style="text-align:center"><div class="breath-circle" id="breath-circle"><div class="count" id="breath-count">Ready</div></div><div class="muted">4-4-6 pacing: inhale 4, hold 4, exhale 6. Repeat at a comfortable pace.</div><div style="margin-top:10px;display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:center"><button class="primary btn" id="start-breathe">Start</button><button class="btn" id="stop-breathe">Stop</button></div></div>';
        area.appendChild(wrap);
        const circle = document.getElementById('breath-circle');
        const count = document.getElementById('breath-count');
        let running = false;
        let phase = 0; // 0 inhale, 1 hold, 2 exhale
        let step = 0;
        let durations = [4,4,6];
        const startBtn = document.getElementById('start-breathe');
        const stopBtn = document.getElementById('stop-breathe');
        function tick(){
          if(!running) return;
          step++;
          if(step>durations[phase]){ step=1; phase=(phase+1)%3; }
          const remaining = durations[phase]-step+1;
          count.textContent = remaining;
          // visual
          const total = durations[phase];
          const pct = (step/total);
          if(phase===0) circle.style.transform = 'scale('+(1+0.3*pct)+')';
          if(phase===1) circle.style.transform = 'scale(1.3)';
          if(phase===2) circle.style.transform = 'scale('+(1.3 - 0.3*pct)+')';
        }
        startBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>{
          if(running) return;
          running=true; phase=0; step=0; count.textContent='4';
          tick(); activeTimer = setInterval(tick,1000);
        });
        stopBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>{ running=false; if(activeTimer) { clearInterval(activeTimer); activeTimer=null; } count.textContent='Stopped'; circle.style.transform='scale(1)'; });
      }

      function renderJournaling(){
        area.innerHTML = '';
        const wrap = document.createElement('div');
        wrap.innerHTML = '<div><div style="margin-bottom:8px"><strong>Two-minute prompt</strong><div class="muted">Write freely for two minutes: What is one small observation about today that feels important?</div></div><textarea id="journal-text" rows="6" style="width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(11,15,26,0.06)"></textarea><div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px"><button class="primary btn" id="start-journal">Start 2:00</button><button class="btn" id="save-journal">Save</button><button class="btn" id="clear-journal">Clear</button></div><div id="journal-timer" class="muted" style="margin-top:8px"></div></div>';
        area.appendChild(wrap);
        const ta = document.getElementById('journal-text');
        const timer = document.getElementById('journal-timer');
        const start = document.getElementById('start-journal');
        const save = document.getElementById('save-journal');
        const clear = document.getElementById('clear-journal');
        let secLeft = 0; let t=null;
        start.addEventListener('click',()=>{
          secLeft = 120; timer.textContent = '2:00'; ta.focus();
          t = setInterval(()=>{ secLeft--; const mm = Math.floor(secLeft/60); const ss = String(secLeft%60).padStart(2,'0'); timer.textContent = mm+':'+ss; if(secLeft<=0){ clearInterval(t); t=null; timer.textContent='Done'; } },1000);
        });
        save.addEventListener('click',()=>{
          const val = ta.value.trim(); if(!val) return alert('Nothing to save'); const key = 'journal-'+new Date().toISOString(); localStorage.setItem(key,val); alert('Saved to your browser storage');
        });
        clear.addEventListener('click',()=>{ ta.value=''; timer.textContent=''; if(t){ clearInterval(t); t=null; } });
      }

      function renderIntention(){
        area.innerHTML = '';
        const wrap = document.createElement('div');
        wrap.innerHTML = '<div><strong>Set a short intention</strong><div class="muted">Choose one clear, small aim for the next 24 hours.</div><div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px"><input id="intent-input" placeholder="I will..." style="flex:1;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(11,15,26,0.06)"><button class="primary btn" id="save-intent">Keep</button></div><div id="intent-saved" class="muted" style="margin-top:8px"></div></div>';
        area.appendChild(wrap);
        const input = document.getElementById('intent-input');
        const save = document.getElementById('save-intent');
        const out = document.getElementById('intent-saved');
        save.addEventListener('click',()=>{
          const v = input.value.trim(); if(!v) { out.textContent='Write a brief intention.'; return; }
          localStorage.setItem('intent',v); out.textContent = 'Saved: "'+v+'"';
        });
      }

      modal.addEventListener('click',function(e){ const el = e.target.closest('[data-ex]'); if(!el) return; const ex = el.getAttribute('data-ex'); if(activeTimer){ clearInterval(activeTimer); activeTimer=null; } if(ex==='breathing') renderBreathing(); if(ex==='journaling') renderJournaling(); if(ex==='intention') renderIntention(); });
    })();

    // Scroll reveal with prefers-reduced-motion support
    (function(){
      const prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      const items = document.querySelectorAll('[data-reveal]');
      if(prefersReduced){ items.forEach(i=>{ i.classList.remove('reveal-hidden'); i.classList.add('reveal-show'); }); return; }
      const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries)=>{
        entries.forEach(entry=>{
          if(entry.isIntersecting){ entry.target.classList.add('reveal-show'); entry.target.classList.remove('reveal-hidden'); io.unobserve(entry.target); }
        });
      },{threshold:0.12});
      items.forEach(i=>{ i.classList.add('reveal-hidden'); io.observe(i); });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"specialties.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Areas of focus — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fff;--card:#fff;--muted:#596067;--accent:#6b9cff;--accent-2:#48b499;--text:#071023}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Arial;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fbfdff 0%,#ffffff 40%);color:var(--text)}
    .nav{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:14px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
    .logo{font-weight:700;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:#fff;padding:8px;border-radius:8px}
    nav a{margin:0 8px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}
    .hero{max-width:1100px;margin:22px auto;padding:32px;border-radius:12px;background:url('assets/img/pattern.svg') no-repeat right/320px;padding-right:40px;display:flex;gap:22px}
    .hero h1{margin:0 0 6px}
    .hero p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}

    main{max-width:1100px;margin:18px auto;padding:0 18px}
    .cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}
    .card{background:var(--card);padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(7,16,35,0.04)}
    .muted{color:var(--muted)}

    .reveal-hidden{opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px);transition:opacity 540ms ease,transform 540ms ease}
    .reveal-show{opacity:1;transform:none}
    @media (max-width:920px){.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero{flex-direction:column;padding-right:20px}}

    .modal-backdrop{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.45);display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
    .modal{background:#fff;padding:16px;border-radius:10px;max-width:720px;width:92%}
    .btn{padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(7,16,35,0.06);background:transparent}
    .primary{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border:none}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="nav">
    <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center"><div class="logo">TP</div><div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div></div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Start</a>
      <a href="about.html">About</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Areas</a>
      <a href="approach.html">Process</a>
      <a href="book.html">Schedule</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
    </nav>
    <div><a class="btn primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero" role="banner">
    <div style="flex:1">
      <h1>Common themes I support</h1>
      <p class="muted">A practical, reflective approach to the challenges people bring: I aim to help you notice patterns, reduce friction, and practice alternatives that actually fit into your routine.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:12px"><button class="btn" id="try-now">Try it now</button></div>
    </div>
    <div style="width:280px;background:rgba(75,164,150,0.06);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;align-self:flex-start">
      <div style="font-weight:700">Session types</div>
      <div class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">Short packages, assessment blocks, and ongoing care.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <main>
    <section class="cards" aria-label="Focus areas">
      <article class="card reveal-hidden" data-reveal>
        <h3>Transitions & life changes</h3>
        <p class="muted">Grief, career shifts, relationship changes — a brief enabling sequence helps clarify choices and reduce overwhelm.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card reveal-hidden" data-reveal>
        <h3>Anxiety that limits action</h3>
        <p class="muted">We examine what keeps worry active and practice small experiments to enlarge what feels possible.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card reveal-hidden" data-reveal>
        <h3>Relationship patterns</h3>
        <p class="muted">When familiar cycles keep repeating, we track triggers and rehearse different moves in a contained setting.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card reveal-hidden" data-reveal>
        <h3>Self-criticism & low mood</h3>
        <p class="muted">Gentle, evidence-informed strategies to soften harsh self-talk and build reliable daily practices.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card reveal-hidden" data-reveal>
        <h3>Parenting stress</h3>
        <p class="muted">Short-term focused work to identify realistic steps and reduce chronic fatigue and worry.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card reveal-hidden" data-reveal>
        <h3>Work-related overwhelm</h3>
        <p class="muted">Practical boundaries, decision tools, and brief behavioral experiments to test new patterns at work.</p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="card reveal-hidden" data-reveal style="margin-top:18px">
      <h2>How I approach an area</h2>
      <p class="muted">We begin with an assessment: current patterns, what has helped or not helped before, and one or two practical changes to try. I provide observations, simple skills, and accountability — all within confidential clinical limits.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:10px;display:flex;gap:8px"><a class="btn" href="approach.html">Learn about process</a><button class="btn" id="try-now-2">Try it now</button></div>
    </section>

    <section class="card reveal-hidden" data-reveal style="margin-top:18px">
      <h2>Confidentiality & limits</h2>
      <p class="muted">Therapy content is private with exceptions required by law, such as imminent risk of harm. I will always discuss these boundaries openly if they become relevant.</p>
